---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Travel — V.T.R. Ravi Kumar" description="Travel stories, journeys and practical notes from V.T.R. Ravi Kumar."><main><header><p class="label">Travel</p><h1>Twenty years on the road.</h1><p>Countries, journeys and the stories behind them — with practical notes on what worked, what didn't and what I would do differently.</p></header><section class="structure"><div><span>01</span><h2>Continents</h2><p>Travel is organised geographically, beginning with continent and country.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h2>Trips</h2><p>Each journey gets a reusable record for dates, places, flights, accommodation, transport, rides and photography.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h2>Stories</h2><p>The detailed part: memories, experiences, mistakes to avoid, where to stay, what stood out and what is worth doing again.</p></div></section><section class="next"><p class="label">Travel index</p><h2>Explore the journeys by continent and country.</h2><p>The country index is being assembled from the authoritative travel list. Status is preserved exactly as recorded: Y means visited; X means cannot be visited.</p></section></main></BaseLayout>
<style>main{width:min(1000px,calc(100% - 3rem));margin:0 auto}header{padding:8rem 0 5rem;max-width:850px}h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,6rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.05em}header>p:last-child{max-width:700px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.7}.label{color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.structure{border-top:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--foreground) 15%,transparent);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.structure>div{padding:3rem 2rem 3rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--foreground) 15%,transparent)}.structure span{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted)}.structure h2{margin:1rem 0 0;font-size:2rem}.structure p,.next p:not(.label){color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}.next{padding:7rem 0;border-top:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--foreground) 15%,transparent)}.next h2{max-width:800px;margin:0;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.04em}.next p:not(.label){max-width:700px}@media(max-width:700px){main{width:min(100% - 2rem,1000px)}header{padding:5rem 0 3rem}.structure{grid-template-columns:1fr}.structure>div{padding:2.5rem 0}.next{padding:5rem 0}}
</style>
